To test, simply go to a L1 space and retrieve available VCs where there is one in the parent L0 space:

```
query AvailableVirtualContributorsInSpaceL0($spaceId: UUID!) {
  lookup {
    space(ID: $spaceId) {
      id
      community {
        id
        roleSet {
          id
          availableVirtualContributorsForEntryRole {
            virtualContributors {
              id
              profile {
                id
                displayName
                description
                url
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

